hwui: HintSessionWrapper.h includes <memory>

Not an upstream commit on its own. android-16.0.0_r1 has the same line.

Why: the header uses std::shared_ptr and relied on <future> pulling in
<memory>, which the libc++ of clang 21 no longer does. Build fix with no
effect on generated code.

diff --git a/libs/hwui/renderthread/HintSessionWrapper.h b/libs/hwui/renderthread/HintSessionWrapper.h
index 859cc57dea9..4c9656792da 100644
--- a/libs/hwui/renderthread/HintSessionWrapper.h
+++ b/libs/hwui/renderthread/HintSessionWrapper.h
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@
 #include <private/performance_hint_private.h>
 
 #include <future>
+#include <memory>
 #include <optional>
 #include <vector>
 
